[Quotes]
victory1 = "Oh, lighten up, you wimp. It's just a fight!"
victory2 = "You need help. There's no way you're going to win!"
victory3 = "Consider yourself lucky to be alive. Pick up your liver and go!"
victory4 = "Have you had enough? Then beat it, fool!"
victory5 = "Why did you do it? You never had a chance."
victory6 = "Bye, bye, baby. Game over."
victory7 = "Don't feel bad. This is just my job."
victory8 = "What a novice. Butch up, you punk!"
victory9 = "You should've expected that. I know I did."
victory10 = "I'm always the winner. You should've known that."
victory11 = "Now, get out of here...if you want to live."
victory12 = "To fight is to win...or lose. That's it. ...Wait a minute...."
victory13 = "Oh, stop whimpering. A wound like that won't kill you."
victory14 = "Ground-to-ground, anti-air...I'm a human missile defense system."
victory15 = "I'm warning you...stand up again, and...."
victory16 = "This is only a scratch. My mission continues...."
victory17 = "Now, stay still. Move, and your wounds will open up."
victory18 = "Stop cowering. I'm through with you."
victory19 = "You need more training. That's all I've got to say."
victory20 = "A bloodless battle on both sides. That suits me fine."
victory30 = "I know how to overcome myself. This removes all doubt."
victory31 = "British special forces, huh. You weren't too bad. But I'm better."
victory32 = "That hairstyle and that attitude...you're not fit for even the American military. Go home and be a family man."
victory33 = "Guess Air Force jockeys can put up a good fight after all."
victory34 = "Your genuine power would make you kind of cute...if you weren't so large."
victory35 = "Those empty eyes...I hate to say it, but they remind me of my own."
victory36 = "Now back to my mission...you'll back me up, right?"
victory37 = "I've mastered assasssination. My mission continues, sir."